COMMENT     Sequence-verified BsaI assembly. Two BsmBI cassettes retained: F6
            AAAC/GGTG and F17 TTGT/CCGA. Both require compatible donors for
            round two; donors not checked. Origin is TTTC preceding F1. No
            protein or functional annotations inferred.
